&lt;li&gt;Have a relentless drive and desire to be the very best at what they do;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess an unparalleled work ethic with a high sense of urgency;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of everything they do, are proactive and follow through on commitments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about people and love to speak, build and nurture relations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an excellent communicator (especially) verbally and in writing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are well-organised and display the ability to structure and prioritise their work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
